                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE TRANSMISSION D'ALIMENTATION SANS FIL ET DISPOSITIF ASSOCIÉ</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">WIRELESS POWER TRANSMISSION METHOD AND DEVICE THEREFOR</invention-title>
